/*Question 1: Using the textbooks table, make a list of all of the textbooks. Include the subject, the current book title, and the out of date book title. Order the results by the current textbook title.*/ 
SELECT CurrentTextbooks.TextbookID, CurrentTextbooks.Subject, CurrentTextbooks.Title, UpdatedTextbooks.UpdatedVersion
FROM Textbooks CurrentTextbooks
LEFT JOIN Textbooks UpdatedTextbooks
ON CurrentTextbooks.TextbookID = UpdatedTextbooks.UpdatedVersion
ORDER BY UpdatedTextbooks.UpdatedVersion;


